{"id":"cee54b08acdf9958","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-effective-real-cut.md","title":"Cuts and Right-c.e. Reals","display":"df-effective-real-cut — Cuts and Right-c.e. Reals","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-effective-real-cut","aliases":["43-df-effective-real-cut"],"display":"df-effective-real-cut — Cuts and Right-c.e. Reals","depends_on":["[[43-df-leftcomputable]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§8.1, representing reals","source_printed_pages":"132–134","source_pdf_pages":"152–154","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-effective-real-cut"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-effective-real-cut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-real-cut — Cuts and Right-c.e. Reals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§8.1, representing reals"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"132–134"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"152–154"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RightComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{RightComputable}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\mathbb Q:q&lt;\\alpha\\},\\qquad R(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\mathbb Q:q&gt;\\alpha\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\mathbb Q:q&lt;\\alpha\\},\\qquad R(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\mathbb Q:q&gt;\\alpha\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RightComputable}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(-\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RightComputable}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(-\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§8.1, representing reals；印刷页 132–134，PDF 页 152–154。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RightComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"L(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\mathbb Q:q<\\alpha\\},\\qquad R(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\{q\\in\\mathbb Q:q>\\alpha\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RightComputable}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(-\\alpha).","display":true}],"bytes":1278,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-real-cut]] — Cuts and Right-c.e. Reals"},{"id":"af397ba861d72428","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]，$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\mathrm{RightComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]]，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 并作用于序列 $X$。"},{"id":"d20bc2bc77d088a6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$；$L(\\alpha)$、$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]]、[[43-df-leftcomputable]]。$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，有理数集合按固定有效编码解释。"},{"id":"9f037d0e39b6df5a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$；左右 c.e. 谓词见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-effective-real-cut]]，$\\mathrm{ComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-real]]。"}],"outgoing":["e7d00f16a112ff92"]}